gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Ho ho! There you are at last!\p"
	.string "Welcome to the DIGITAL WORLD!\p"
	.string "My name is JIJIMON.\p"
	.string "I am the elder of PRIMARY\n"
	.string "VILLAGE, here on FILE ISLAND.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This little one is a “DIGIMON.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "This world is made of data, and\n"
	.string "it is home to creatures called\l"
	.string "DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "Every DIGIMON is born as an egg\n"
	.string "in our village, then grows,\l"
	.string "battles and DIGIVOLVES.\p"
	.string "Lately, something has been\n"
	.string "corrupting their data…\p"
	.string "Wild DIGIMON rage, and strange\n"
	.string "thickets choke the forest paths.\p"
	.string "So a DIGIVICE has called\n"
	.string "a human TAMER here.\l"
	.string "That TAMER is you!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "But first, who are you?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Ho ho! {PLAYER}{KUN}, the TAMER\n"
	.string "the DIGIVICE chose.\l"
	.string "A fine name!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "Now then, are you ready?\p"
	.string "Your partner DIGIMON is waiting\n"
	.string "for you in PRIMARY VILLAGE.\p"
	.string "Grow strong together, and set\n"
	.string "FILE ISLAND right again!\p"
	.string "Now, into the DIGITAL WORLD!\p"
	.string "$"
